            "sequence": 1,
            "source_id": "80856-1791156704276707000-698"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "It's located in the southeast region, and it's currently spring. I'm planning to explore the wetlands and forests areas, as I've heard they're good spots for spotting waterfowl and songbirds."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-04-01",
            "sequence": 2,
            "source_id": "80856-1791156883059692000-747"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I've been meaning to try out the Merlin Bird ID app that Sarah recommended at the workshop today, do you think it would be helpful in identifying warblers?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-04-01",
            "sequence": 4,
            "source_id": "80856-1791157231601055000-839"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm wondering if Merlin can also help with bird calls and songs, as I've been trying to improve my skills in identifying birds by their songs."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-04-01",
            "sequence": 5,
            "source_id": "80856-1791157376569456000-890"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "no_candidates_unreviewed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm planning to focus on the wetlands area first, as I've heard that's where the warblers tend to congregate during migration. Do you think the Merlin app would be able to help me identify any warblers I might spot in the wetlands?"
